From: MirrorRelay maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] auto/os/linux: allow forcing PR_SET_KEEPCAPS result

Nginx 1.30 added a second prctl run probe after the upstream-derived
cross-compilation patch set was last refreshed.  Give it the same explicit
cross result mechanism so configure never tries to execute a target binary.

---
 auto/os/linux | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/auto/os/linux b/auto/os/linux
--- a/auto/os/linux
+++ b/auto/os/linux
@@ -186,6 +186,7 @@ ngx_include="sys/prctl.h"; . auto/include
 ngx_feature="prctl(PR_SET_KEEPCAPS)"
 ngx_feature_name="NGX_HAVE_PR_SET_KEEPCAPS"
 ngx_feature_run=yes
+ngx_feature_run_force_result="$ngx_force_have_pr_set_keepcaps"
 ngx_feature_incs="#include <sys/prctl.h>"
 ngx_feature_path=
 ngx_feature_libs=
